# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Round-2 reasoning record (September 2026).  Same category again: working
# notes, cross-audit exchanges and derivation scaffolding.  They are how the
# results were arrived at and argued over, not the results themselves, and the
# archive cited by the manuscript should carry the second and not the first.
# Nothing here appears in provenance/MANIFEST.tsv or is cited by either paper,
# so ignoring them breaks no reference.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The running ledger: what is established, what is retracted, who found what.
NonStationaryMetrics/AVANZAMENTI_ROUND2.md

# Handoffs written for the second agent, and its replies.  The pattern needs the
# leading ** : without it, paper1/HANDOFF_CODEX_round2.md and
# paper1/HANDOFF_CODEX_production.md were tracked for months.
**/HANDOFF_CODEX_*.md
**/SESSION_HANDOFF_*.md
NonStationaryMetrics/audit_CQG_2026-09-10/

# Derivation companion: every step written out, for reading and explaining.
# The papers carry the statements; this carries the algebra behind them.
NonStationaryMetrics/DERIVAZIONI_COMPLETE.tex
NonStationaryMetrics/DERIVAZIONI_COMPLETE.pdf
NonStationaryMetrics/DERIVAZIONI_COMPLETE.aux
NonStationaryMetrics/DERIVAZIONI_COMPLETE.log
NonStationaryMetrics/DERIVAZIONI_COMPLETE.out

# Corrections held for Paper I until JMP replies, so that manuscript is edited
# once.  KEEP A COPY OUTSIDE THIS WORKING TREE: it is the only record of the
# repaired existence proof, and it is deliberately untracked.
NonStationaryMetrics/paper1/PENDING_JMP_CORRECTIONS.md

# Deposit copy for the Zenodo record: the working notes (.md) plus the two
# renderings pasted into the description field (.txt, .html).  The glob covers
# the next version too -- the previous rule named v5 alone, so the .txt and
# .html generated from it stayed untracked only by accident.
NonStationaryMetrics/paper1/ZENODO_*DESCRIPTION.md
NonStationaryMetrics/paper1/ZENODO_*description.*

# Release notes drafted here and pasted into the GitHub release form.  The
# release itself is the published copy; keeping a second one in the tree only
# invites the two to drift.
NonStationaryMetrics/paper2/RELEASE_NOTES_v*.md

# Draft response to the Round-2 reports, superseded once the final letter is
# written in the author's own voice.
NonStationaryMetrics/paper2/referee_response_round2_draft.*

# Independent C1-C8 verification report answering the Codex handoff.
# Working document, same category as the handoff itself.
NonStationaryMetrics/VERIFICA_CATENA_C1_C8.md


